</span><span style=\"font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">학자금대출관련 외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">무지개 장학사업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2026. 5. 6.(</span><span style=\"font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) ~ 7. 10.(</span><span style=\"font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">), 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-size:9.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:9.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;※</span><span style=\"font-family:나눔바른고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕;font-size:9.0pt;\">디딤돌</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:나눔바른고딕